                "word": "involution",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8be20b18-dd99-4e7d-8464-b8bbeb2c9263",
                        "entry_id": "5ef79b06-b347-3568-980b-c0772a161211",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "involutions"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ffcd2f12-d349-3ca5-a965-ee7c06d4fd5c",
                        "entry_id": "5ef79b06-b347-3568-980b-c0772a161211",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Entanglement; a spiralling inwards; intricacy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "34a7840e-82c4-4232-992b-76dc83373de5",
                                "sense_id": "ffcd2f12-d349-3ca5-a965-ee7c06d4fd5c",
                                "text": "[…]usually his attention was diverted from her feet by her shrieks of laughter and the astounding involutions of her huge brown-yellow frame."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0be6aa9-f504-4827-b021-16f4dfd3d823",
                                "sense_id": "ffcd2f12-d349-3ca5-a965-ee7c06d4fd5c",
                                "text": "‘Gomez,’ said the mortician, ‘is an expert only on the involutions of his own rectum.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bec24caf-7162-3be6-b7fc-450b9694957f",
                        "entry_id": "5ef79b06-b347-3568-980b-c0772a161211",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A complicated grammatical construction."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4ba8bde-bb05-4049-a031-0e586bbe1993",
                                "sense_id": "bec24caf-7162-3be6-b7fc-450b9694957f",
                                "text": "1917, James Huneker, Unicorns, New York: Scribner, Chapter 11 “Style and Rhythm in English Prose,” p. 129,\nWalter Pater’s essay on Style is honeycombed with involutions and preciosity."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7801967e-fe5d-34ab-8e13-651552c3faf0",
                        "entry_id": "5ef79b06-b347-3568-980b-c0772a161211",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An endofunction whose square is equal to the identity function; a function equal to its inverse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5a0d8b1-ae66-4432-a687-8c64f86f291b",
                                "sense_id": "7801967e-fe5d-34ab-8e13-651552c3faf0",
                                "text": "Involutions have the property that they are their own inverses."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4d52baa1-1d9a-38c2-a2ea-10ab3c3c3997",
                        "entry_id": "5ef79b06-b347-3568-980b-c0772a161211",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The shrinking of an organ (such as the uterus) to a former size."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "752b51c0-2454-3a0f-81ab-70e421d590b2",
                        "entry_id": "5ef79b06-b347-3568-980b-c0772a161211",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The regressive changes in the body occurring with old age."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a427e52-5a93-3f09-95c8-d68b9fe839ae",
                        "entry_id": "5ef79b06-b347-3568-980b-c0772a161211",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A power: the result of raising one number to the power of another."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "obsolete",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "395cdc9e-9c39-32e6-bd40-d58183ea8511",
                        "entry_id": "5ef79b06-b347-3568-980b-c0772a161211",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A cessation of development or progress involving intense inner competition."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dd433481-ab0f-3f77-ad8e-be39eb79cee3",
                        "entry_id": "5ef79b06-b347-3568-980b-c0772a161211",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A state of increased competition for limited resources, requiring great effort to stay ahead."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "neologism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cbd00250-f50d-3bac-a1e2-626384eb05d7",
                        "entry_id": "5ef79b06-b347-3568-980b-c0772a161211",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The migration of a cell layer inward, sliding over an outer layer of cells. It occurs at gastrulation during embryogenesis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
